# Platform Redux

- Typed hooks from `features/app/app.hooks.ts`: `useAppDispatch`, `useAppSelector`, `useAppStore`
- Prefer selectors over reading nested state in components
- Feature state: `createSlice` + `createAsyncThunk` colocated as `*.slice.ts` / `*.selectors.ts`
- Server APIs: RTK Query under `apps/platform/queries/` (`createApi`, `gfwBaseQuery`) — not TanStack Query
- Keep async errors normalized (`parseAPIError` / existing async-slice helpers)
- Do not introduce new `react-query` usage in platform
